WEBVTT

00:01:57.808 --> 00:02:00.097
Well, ratings affect you.

00:02:00.097 --> 00:02:02.259
They affect all of us.

00:02:02.259 --> 00:02:05.564
If a rating agency rates a country,

00:02:05.564 --> 00:02:08.839
it basically assesses and evaluates

00:02:08.839 --> 00:02:10.240
a country's debt

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:12.589
and the ability and willingness of a country

00:02:12.589 --> 00:02:14.930
to repay its debt.

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:17.863
So if a country gets downgraded by a rating agency,

00:02:17.863 --> 00:02:19.940
the country has to pay more

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:21.547
in order to borrow money

00:02:21.547 --> 00:02:23.108
on the international markets.

00:02:23.108 --> 00:02:25.909
So it affects you as a citizen and as a taxpayer,

00:02:25.909 --> 00:02:28.272
because you and your fellow countrymen

00:02:28.272 --> 00:02:32.062
have to pony up more in order to borrow.